n v. State\">245 Ga. 266</a></span>, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1325209\"><a href=\"/opinion/1325209/mulligan-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Mulligan v. State\">264 S. E. 2d 204</a></span>; No. 80-5163, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9644368\"><a href=\"/opinion/1511441/esquivel-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Esquivel v. State\">595 S. W. 2d 516</a></span>; No. 80-5249, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1928345\"><a href=\"/opinion/1928345/reddix-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Reddix v. State\">381 So. 2d 999</a></span>; No. 80-5399, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1136892\"><a href=\"/opinion/1136892/state-v-jordan/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: State v. Jordan\">126 Ariz. 283</a></span>, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1136892\"><a href=\"/opinion/1136892/state-v-jordan/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: State v. Jordan\">614 P. 2d 825</a></span>.</p>\n</opinion>"},{"id":9022923,"type":"dissent","typeCode":"040dissent","perCuriam":false,"author":"Brennanmarshall","joinedBy":"","pageCount":null,"textLength":599,"isHtml":true,"text":"<opinion type=\"dissent\">\n<author id=\"b1000-16\">Justice Brennan and Justice Marshall,</author>\n<p id=\"AsTv\">dissenting.</p>\n<p id=\"b1000-17\">Adhering to our views that the death penalty is in all circumstances cruel and unusual punishment prohibited by the Eighth and Fourteenth Amendments, <em>Gregg </em>v. <em>Georgia, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9426555\"><a href=\"/opinion/109532/gregg-v-georgia/#227\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Gregg v. Georgia\">428 U. S. 153, 227, 231</a></span> (1976), we would grant certiorari and vacate the death sentences in these cases.</p>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}